    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1165">

                <pb facs="1009" n="905" xml:id="pg905"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.52/55.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            American Ambassador to Spain.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-12-13">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">December 13, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your December 12. Instructions were sent yesterday to American Consul at
                    Chihuahua to make proper representations to Villa. Department is today sending
                    special consular representative<anchor n="1" xml:id="d1165-f1"/> who has
                    favorable acquaintance with Villa to reinforce representations Consul at
                    Chihuahua is expected to make.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d1165-f1" n="1" xml:id="d1165-f1-content">
                <p>Mr. Carothers.</p>
